NOTE: the wasm checked into the grammar repo is stale (built 2024-08 for
tree-sitter 0.22.6) and fails to load in web-tree-sitter 0.26.x
("unknown section code"). Always rebuild from source:

  git clone https://github.com/UserNobody14/tree-sitter-dart && cd tree-sitter-dart
  git checkout <commit>
  npx -y tree-sitter-cli@<web-tree-sitter version> build --wasm -o tree-sitter-dart.wasm .

The CLI downloads wasi-sdk automatically; no emscripten/docker needed.
Keep tree-sitter-cli and web-tree-sitter versions in lockstep.
